WEBVTT

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:20.480
<i>I hope you two are faring well in the midst of summer.</i>

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:25.620
<i>Finally, I have returned.</i>

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:31.000
Grill it but don't forget to cut the bones.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.490
Summer is the best time to eat it.

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:37.290
What's the matter, Yonakuni?

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.540
Oh? Can I help you?

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.040
Nice to meet you!

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:47.380
I'm Miki, the younger sister of 
Miyamae Kanako, a resident of this place.

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:24.790
First of all,

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:30.290
summer vacation was established because it gets too hot to study, right?

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:35.670
So why do I have to attend the special summer course every single day and do so much homework?

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:36.880
Don't you think it's wrong?

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:43.350
Perhaps it's because you miraculously failed every subject during the finals.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.390
But since most schools these days have air conditioning systems,

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.810
not being able to study because of the weather

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.150
is no longer a valid reason to take a break during the summer.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.020
To not sweat during summer, what a joke.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.150
That's not right!

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.730
Summer is supposed to be hot!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.490
The sweat drops sparkling on the sun-kissed skin of beautiful girls.

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.660
The white summer uniform that becomes translucent from the sweat.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.280
Isn't that what summer is all about?

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.330
Come on, everyone! Let's get sweaty!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.580
Let's sweat!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.710
Knock, knock, knock.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.250
Miyamae, you have a guest.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:16.550
What?

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:21.800
Mariya, Matsurika, thank you for always watching over my sister.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.760
No way! Lil' Miki!

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.680
Did you come to see your big sister?

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:30.480
Come on, sit right here! You don't have to be so formal!

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.650
Don't act so familiar with me.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:36.770
Come on! You're strict, but you're still cute!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.150
I think you've gotten even cuter since I last saw you!

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:43.030
I think you've gotten even <i>bigger</i> since I last saw you.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.620
Oh, I see that's a sensitive subject for you.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:51.410
Welcome to Ame-no-Kisaki, Miki!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.130
I'm sure you're exhausted from the long trip.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.590
Thank you for your kindness.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:01.260
I see you've become amazingly beautiful since last we met.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:03.970
Last you met?

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.390
Oh yeah, Kanako.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.260
Here you go.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:12.640
This is...

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:22.360
I can't believe they really sent it to you!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.860
And this is for Mariya.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.950
It's the graduation essay my sister wrote in junior high.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:28.850
How lovely.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.390
W-W-Wait...

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:35.140
Of all the places, she hid it behind the panel of a vent.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:37.520
Wait a minute! What's going on?

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:41.070
So you two have been in contact?

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:43.900
I won't approve of this as long as I live!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:49.240
When I grow up I will become a genius pastry chef

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.700
because my little sister loves cakes.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.540
I will become a genius copyrider instead.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:02.050
That's interesting, isn't it?

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:04.260
Yes, especially from here on.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:07.470
There are so many other things I want to be,

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:12.520
but what I want to be the most is a princess.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:16.890
I want to be a pretty princess so that a prince will come and pick me up.

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:20.060
So she used to like men, I see.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:22.820
The prince picking her up, huh? How romantic.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:29.030
I'm sorry that you have to live with her. She's so embarrassing.

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:31.990
It's not something you should worry about.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:35.960
So you won't deny that my sister has embarrassed herself?

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:36.870
Oh my.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.370
I'm glad.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:41.380
You must be good friends with my sister.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.380
Huh? Kanako, that's...

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.890
The graduation essay from elementary school.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.850
Let me see! Let me see!

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.810
Well, I'm not sure if I should...

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.100
I understand.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:00.480
It's a little embarrassing to let others read your graduation essay.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:02.020
I see.

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.520
Now that I think about it,

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:06.990
I wrote embarrassing things like my dreams and goals.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:11.530
That's right. I remember writing I wanted to get a job at the Foreign Ministry.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:16.040
I think I wrote that I wanted to be just like the Virgin Mary.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:20.540
I wrote that I wished for world peace.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.000
Now that I look back on it, it's embarrassing.

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:29.050
<i>Their standards are completely different from mine!</i>

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:38.350
<i>Just what happened to you, Miyamae?</i>

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.310
<i>You look so sad.</i>

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.150
<i>That's her elementary school graduation essay.</i>

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:51.070
<i>Children often talk about what they want to be when they grow up and what their dreams are in those essays.</i>

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:56.040
<i>Is it possible that Miyamae is torn by the gap between her dream and reality?</i>

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:56.790
<i>If that's the case,</i>

00:06:57.330 --> 00:07:01.670
<i>as an educator, I must teach her that her dreams will come true if she believes in them!</i>

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:06.340
Today's summer special course will be a little different.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.460
I would like to talk about dreams!

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.220
Father Kanae?!

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:15.350
<i>But wait a second! What about me?</i>

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:19.020
<i>Did the dream I wrote in my elementary graduation essay come true?</i>

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.100
<i>My dream was...</i>

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:27.020
<i>To become a wonderful groom!</i>

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.190
<i>However!</i>

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:33.070
<i>Catholic principles prohibit reverend fathers from getting married!</i>

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:40.290
<i>In other words, my dream to become a groom will never come true.</i>

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:46.880
<i>Yet, the final angel has descended to Ame-no-Kisaki, Shidoh Mariya!</i>

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:52.720
<i>Furthermore, I've encountered Shinouji Matsurika, Shiki Ayari, as well as Natsuru Maki!</i>

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:58.720
<i>To tell her that her dreams will come true if she believes in them would be utterly irresponsible.</i>

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.730
<i>Exactly how should I approach her?</i>

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:03.560
Father Kanae?

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:08.360
Miyamae!

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:09.530
Dreams don't come true!

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:12.740
Be strong, just like me!

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:16.570
<i>Hermann und Dorothea!</i>

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.550
Kanako!

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:39.720
M-Miki, what are you doing here?

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:44.980
Mariya has gone to her club, 
so I've been wandering around by myself.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:50.780
Hey, by the way, earlier you sounded like you've known Mariya for a while.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:53.110
Have you met her before?

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:54.110
Yeah...

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:59.450
Remember the time we all came to Ame-no-Kisaki as a family after Mom died?

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:05.710
I didn't understand much back then because I was still little.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:10.460
After that I visited Ame-no-Kisaki again by myself.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:13.340
I wanted to find out more about Dad and Mom.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.880
Miki...

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:18.640
Remember the time I ran away from home when I was in elementary school?

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:20.600
I came here...

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:26.640
Irene told me about how Dad and Mom met at this academy

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:29.900
without treating me like a child.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:35.150
Irene... You mean Mariya's grandmother and Ame-no-Kisaki's director?

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:42.370
I'll contact your home,

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.040
so stay here for a while and make yourself comfortable.

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:47.580
Mariya, I want you to take care of Miki

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.380
since you're older than her.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:57.630
That's when I first met Mariya.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:58.340
What?

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:02.350
Oh, what's the matter, Miyamae?

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.600
Miss Tonomura!

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.720
And who's this?

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.850
I'm Miyamae Kanako's younger sister, Miki.

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.610
You look so cool.

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:14.940
That's the archery uniform, isn't it?

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.150
Do you like archery?

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:21.490
Yoo wamma gib et eh hry?

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:26.870
<i>Dearest Mother, up in Heaven,</i>

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.120
<i>what the hell is happening?</i>

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.220
Bravo!

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:40.680
Miki, you're so cool!

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:46.560
I never thought the day would come when I could draw a bow!

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:47.730
I'm so thrilled!

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.810
Aren't you disappointed this is just a trial?

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.020
No way!

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:54.230
Being able to come into the dojo alone is enough to make me very happy!

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:59.150
Yamaki, this thing I borrowed from you... 
Is it okay to wash it in the washing machine?

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:02.990
You only wore it for a little while, so you can just give it to me without washing it.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:04.740
And come on, Miki.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:07.370
You can stop calling me "Yamaki".

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.460
You can just call me "Komachi" or "Koma".

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:12.790
That's what all my friends call me.

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:16.500
But I call you <i>Yamaki</i> and Shidoh calls you <i>Komachi.</i>

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.340
Mariya is special because she's my lover.

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:20.720
Your lover?

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.840
Not again, Komachi.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:25.800
You call all the cute girls your lover, don't you?

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:28.020
That's right. I love girls!

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.520
Miki can be my lover, too!

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.360
<i>It's strange...</i>

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:40.030
<i>Inamori Yuzuru: a traditional Japanese girl and the pride of Class 2-A.</i>

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:45.530
<i>Satsuki Chifumi: daughter of a sushi chef and the girl next door of Class 3-D.</i>

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:51.500
<i>Yamaki Komachi of Class 1-A: one of the few students to enter this academy from the outside.</i>

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:57.460
<i>Tsumugi Banri of Class 3-F, who has a cheeky young brother at Mihoshi-no-Mori</i>

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:00.010
<i>that needs to be straightened out big time...</i>

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:04.300
<i>And now I'm totally bummed out about the absence of Suzuka Anna,</i>

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:06.140
<i>who's half Japanese and half Russian!</i>

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:11.850
<i>And why is this no fun even though I have by my side the cutest girl in the whole wide world, Miki,</i>

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:14.940
<i>who is so cute and bubbly right now, within reach of a rubber-band gun?</i>

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:17.400
Miki, you have the high school entrance exam coming up next year, right?

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:19.020
You should try for our school!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:21.650
And you'll become the manager of the Archery Club.

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:25.280
Having a cute club mascot would definitely boost the morale of the members!

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:27.410
That's a great idea!

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:30.740
It would be very helpful because we don't have a club manager.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.830
But I'll have graduated by then.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:35.290
What a bummer.

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.250
Come on, guys!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:38.790
Don't get carried away and ignore what she wants!

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:43.090
As a fan of Mariya, I'll take good care of her!

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.840
Come on, Komachi.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:47.550
Please don't give Miki too much trouble.

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:50.010
She's right, Koma.

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:52.930
I can beat you when it comes to how long you've been a fan of Mariya.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:57.350
I was in third grade when I was first enchanted by Mariya.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:59.320
Miki, about that...

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:58.610
What?

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:00.320
You mean when Mariya was in elementary school?

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.440
What kind of kid was she?

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.530
I want to know more about it!

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:06.950
She was already beautiful back then.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:08.660
<i>Miki?</i>

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:13.410
I saw Mariya bravely drawing a bow in her archery uniform.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:16.120
She was cool and exciting to watch.

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.550
Ever since then...

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:33.430
Mariya has been my role model!

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:38.020
Mariya...

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:44.780
Kanako—

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.530
Miki! Come here!

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.370
Kanako!

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:54.790
Wait up!

00:13:58.670 --> 00:13:59.920
What's the matter?

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.290
Why are you mad?

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.670
This is wrong, Miki!

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:03.960
You gotta forget about it!

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:05.300
Forget about what?

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.630
This thing with Mariya. Just forget about it!

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.010
There they are.

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:12.350
You can't look at her with admiration or have your heart throb for her!

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:14.930
You can't only have eyes for her!

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:17.810
Because Mariya is a <i>boy</i>!

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:30.820
<i>Shit! Did I just say that?</i>

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:38.000
I mean, err...

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.880
<i>They're gonna get me!</i>

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:48.130
I-I-I can explain...

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:56.470
Oh my! You and your bizarre jokes, Kanako.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.890
<i>She just smiled!</i>

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:02.980
<i>Why? Is she going to forgive me?</i>

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:05.900
<i>No, no way, Kanako! Don't let your guard down!</i>

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.400
<i>You know who you're dealing with!</i>

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:10.700
<i>I'm sure she's going to wait for Miki and me to lower our guards before pouncing on us!</i>

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.740
T-That's exactly what I thought.

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.660
I'm sorry for my sister's rudeness!

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:15.740
Come on, Kanako, you need to apolog—

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:19.870
Kanako?!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:22.370
I beg you! Please forgive me!

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:27.340
I know you're not going to forgive me just because I apologized,

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:31.050
b-b-but what just happened was solely and exclusively my responsibility, and...

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:34.550
Oh, you! You're so funny, Kanako.

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:37.560
P-P-Please spare Miki.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:39.600
Please spare Miki...

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:42.440
<i>Stop freaking out, woman!</i>

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:47.070
<i>I'm over here trying to let this shit go as if I were a Fairy of the West Wind!</i>

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:51.110
That's enough idling and chatting. Let's go back, shall we?

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.070
I'm sure everyone is worried about—

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:54.530
S-So you're going to forgive me?

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:58.080
<i>Do you want me to go ahead and glue that friggin' mouth shut?</i>

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:03.080
<i>All you've got to do is to shut the hell up and follow us like a duckling!</i>

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:07.290
Suzuka Anna of Class 2 should be arriving soon.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.300
Let's hurry.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:11.420
You've been looking forward to seeing her, haven't you, Kanako?

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:16.090
<i>I see! This must be Mariya's covering fire!</i>

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.350
That's right!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.810
Mariya is not a boy!

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:23.560
You got that, Miki? Mariya is not a boy!

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:22.890
<i>What the hell is this bitch doing now?</i>

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:26.060
Y-Yeah, of course...

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:31.280
I don't break out in hives even when I touch Mariya.

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:34.070
Because Mariya is not a boy.

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:36.950
Mariya.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.540
Here.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:40.560
Gack!

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:45.850
What did you do that for, Miki?!

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.860
I break out in hives when a man touches me!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.110
Wait, I mean...

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.830
Kanako, Matsurika...

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:04.620
Can I please be alone with Mariya for a while?

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.500
I wonder if Miki is all right.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.710
Maybe I shouldn't have left her all alone with that devil.

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:16.130
Will you calm down a little, Kanako?

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:18.660
You'll deal with whatever happens.

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:23.330
Are you okay with leaving Mariya alone?

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:28.840
I don't have a problem because she's okay with it.

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:40.140
Yeah, it's true.

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:41.890
I'm a man.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:44.980
I go to an all-girls' school dressed up as a girl.

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:46.480
Are you happy now?

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.020
Well...

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:51.190
Are you a drag queen? You're not, right?

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:52.440
Do I look like one?

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:53.530
No.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:57.240
I'm not going to ask you why, and I won't tell anyone either.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:59.660
That would be great.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.330
Is there anything else you want to talk about?

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.790
I'll become a student of Ame-no-Kisaki.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:10.420
But your junior high will let you go on to a high school within the same school system, right?

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:15.420
My father wanted to send all his daughters to Ame-no-Kisaki to begin with.

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:19.050
I'm sure he'd be happy if I told him what I want to do.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.760
And I'll join the archery club.

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:22.760
When I do...

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.100
Please go out with me!

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:35.490
I see. A trade-off, huh?

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:38.450
You'll keep the secret, but you want me to be with you.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:40.620
No, that's not it!

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:42.830
I just wanted to confess how I feel about you!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.580
I've been in love with you for a long time!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:47.330
So you want me to be yours even if you have to threaten me in the process.

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:48.460
I'm flattered.

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.750
Please don't say it like that!

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:54.710
Ever since I've met you, you've occupied my thoughts.

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:58.880
You stood with your back straight; focused, unwavering.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:02.640
You have been my ideal for the longest time.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:09.270
But I think it's best for ideals to be kept somewhere high and unreachable.

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:12.610
I couldn't figure out whether the feelings I had for you

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:16.030
were a form of respect or something else entirely.

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:20.990
But I've never even contemplated the possibility that you could be a guy.

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:29.500
I think you're just upset that the person you thought of as a woman turned out to be a man.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:34.040
Go back to the dorm, eat, take a bath, then go to bed.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.380
We can talk about this later.

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:45.510
I'm not from West Philadelphia, but this looks like trouble in the neighborhood.

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:49.770
<i>I witnessed it! The very moment my sister's heart got shattered.</i>

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.650
Yyuh ffo meem, Mafuihha!

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:56.230
Hha hmm yyuh inn' wehf me fhump inn v'fore hings ghah hiss hragihh?

00:19:56.230 --> 00:20:01.150
Don't you think letting you go would've actually worsened the situation even more?

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.280
<i>What a cruel way to treat her!</i>

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:06.700
<i>How should I handle that heretic now?</i>

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:11.750
<i>But the most important thing to do right now is to comfort Miki's broken heart.</i>

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.420
Miki!

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:20.300
All you'll find by keeping your head down is change on the ground!

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:23.050
So you were watching, Kanako.

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.510
I'm so sorry, but I was terribly worried about you.

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:27.720
You jerk!

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:32.730
Regardless, Mariya is still a sweet person.

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:35.900
What? You mean that <i>drill sergeant?!</i>

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:38.480
She avoided dumping me.

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:41.450
She managed to brush off my careless confession

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:43.200
and pretended like nothing ever happened.

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:47.330
Although, to me it appeared that she skillfully dodged the issue

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:50.660
to prevent it from turning into some messy relationship drama.

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:56.210
I'm sorry I showed up unannounced.

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:59.050
Don't worry about it.

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:03.840
The wasabi macarons you brought were just scrumptious.

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:07.350
You should stay a little longer.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:09.260
I can't.

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:12.430
I have to hurry home and convince my father.

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:13.230
What?

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:18.770
I'll be back.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:22.280
Next year I'm going to be a student of Ame-no-Kisaki!

00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:25.200
<i>Dearest Mama, up in Heaven,</i>

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:27.910
<i>At this academy where you and Papa met,</i>

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:31.240
<i>I found the love of my life!</i>

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:06.510
Matsurika's Journal

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:09.260
Good evening, Matsurika here.

00:23:10.300 --> 00:23:13.390
If you're interested, I'll let you in on my childhood dream.

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:26.670
<i>Sorry, no one is home right now.</i>

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:27.840
<i>If you have a message,</i>

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:30.800
<i>please write down your name, address,</i>

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:33.390
<i>and your chess style you can't share with anyone else on a postcard</i>

00:23:33.390 --> 00:23:35.350
<i>and mail it within a week!</i>
